WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
It found one plan. The page has two.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.800
Dropping the rest does not look partial.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.100
So cut the page, not the window.

4
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:16.500
One small question each, instead of one big one.

5
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.100
A plan is a price under its own name.

6
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:24.000
Ten for the price. Eight for the heading.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.900
Two pages write the name and the tagline.

8
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.800
In opposite orders. The shorter one wins.

9
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.100
Six real pages. Four of them new.

10
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.400
Two of the four changed the code.

11
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.900
One page had no prices on it at all.

12
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.700
We reported a feature limit as a price.

13
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:49.500
Now a window without a price cannot win.

14
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.500
The page says so, and that is the finding.

15
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.200
Two things are still wrong on purpose.

16
00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.900
The pages you have not read yet write the code.
